# Service worker artifacts generated by @serwist/next at build time
# (swDest in apps/arena/web/next.config.ts). Never hand-edited; committing it
# causes the checked-in file to silently diverge from whatever a machine
# actually built, which is exactly how a stale precache can end up serving
# obsolete JS chunks (see docs/dev-service-worker-cache-recovery.md).
